    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure staff efficiency and quality of care, our company's solution will be designed to fit into existing practices and workflows, providing drafting assistance, information retrieval, and support for clinical and administrative activities. our company's Atelier platform, which forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organization's own documents, will be adapted to meet the client's specific requirements. our company's will also emphasize data sovereignty, security, and compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR and French health data hosting (HDS) certification. our solution will be hosted on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, ensuring the highest level of security and data protection." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Throughout the project, our company's will maintain a strong governance structure, with a joint steering committee and operational committee, to ensure effective communication and collaboration with the client. our company's single point of contact, the project director, will be responsible for coordinating the consortium efforts and ensuring that all requirements are met." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our company's strengths, past experiences, and consortium partnerships, I am confident that our company's can produce a coherent tender response that addresses the client requirements and provides a high-quality AI assistance solution for the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be designed and implemented with a functional scope of information consultation assistance, allowing staff to quickly access reliable up-to-date information drawn from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also integrate with the hospital information system and electronic patient record (DPI), support health interoperability standards (HL7, FHIR, INS, and DMP), and provide API-type interfaces." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be hosted on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent, with particular attention paid to dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What technical architecture can we propose to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, our company Faber IA can propose a technical architecture that leverages we Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform has components such as a document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer with hybrid search, orchestration layer, and answer layer, which can be used to provide information consultation assistance. our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform can be integrated with the hospital information system and electronic patient record (DPI) using we API-first approach, which includes REST and webhook APIs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we support health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR through we partnership with Ligeo Santé for health interoperability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet the hosting requirements, our Atelier platform, which is a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform can be hosted on SecNumCloud SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements. we also use Kubernetes for containerisation, which allows we to scale horizontally and ensure high availability. we model-agnostic approach means we can work with various models, including sovereign European open-weight models and top-tier proprietary models accessed via API." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This flexibility enables we to provide a solution that meets the client's specific needs while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we existing platform and capabilities, we can propose a technical architecture that meets the client's requirements for information consultation assistance, integration with hospital systems, health interoperability standards, API-type interfaces, and secure hosting on qualified infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict compliance with GDPR, ensuring the protection of personal and health data, with no transfer outside the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also comply with French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification, guaranteeing explainability and traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's certifications, GDPR instruments, AI security controls, audit capabilities, and experience with the European Union regulatory frameworks as of 2024, how can our company's ensure the security and compliance posture of our company's tender response?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a Security & Compliance officer at our company's, I can confirm that our company's holds ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers Development, delivery, and operations. our company's are also certified with ISO 27701, an extension for privacy information management, and HDS certification through our company's hosting infrastructure operated on OuraneCloud.  our company's data protection measures include encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256. our company's use the European Union-based infrastructure for key management, implement pseudonymisation and data minimisation, and provide configurable retention options." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Strict tenant isolation is ensured between client corpora with per-engagement logical separation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) and audit logging of access and system outputs are also in place. our company's have a secure software development life cycle that includes code review, dependency scanning, secrets management, and periodic penetration testing conducted by an external CREST-equivalent provider. our company's vulnerability management process has defined remediation SLAs based on severity, and our company's have incident response procedures with defined detection, notification, and remediation steps." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's requirements for GDPR compliance and HDS certification, our company's existing certifications and data protection measures align well. our company's do not transfer data outside the European Union as per the client's requirement, which is supported by our company's hosting partnership with OuraneCloud." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability and traceability as required by the client, our company's product Atelier supports a posteriori review, medical confidentiality, and traceability. our company's also have experience delivering solutions compliant with GDPR for public-sector and health clients, including special-category (Art. 9) health data, which aligns with the client's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, based on our company's existing certifications, security controls, and regulatory experience as of 2025, our company's can ensure a strong security and compliance posture in our company's tender response that meets the client's requirements for GDPR compliance, HDS certification, and data protection within the European Union." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contract must cover the design, implementation, and deployment of the solution, ensuring strict compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR and French HDS certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client attaches particular importance to data sovereignty, with hosting performed on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with all relevant regulatory frameworks?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As Legal Agent for we, I can confirm that we is a Société par actions simplifiée (SAS) registered in France, with up-to-date social and fiscal obligations. we have experience with public procurement, including framework agreements and standard public clauses such as CCAG-TIC." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding The contract, we can cover design, implementation, and deployment of the solution. we has administrative attestations available, including those required for French public procurement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For regulatory compliance, we Security & Compliance function ensures that we maintain obligations monitored, including GDPR (Article 9 special-category data and Article 28 processing agreements), medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a health context. we can provide certificates of insurance upon request, with professional liability insurance coverage of up to €10 million per claim. we general civil liability cover is also in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for data sovereignty, we understand the importance of hosting on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While we context does not explicitly state that we host data on such infrastructure, we do have experience working within the European Union and can ensure that we solutions comply with relevant regulatory frameworks, including GDPR and French HDS certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I must flag potential legal risks associated with ensuring strict compliance with all regulatory requirements, particularly those related to data sovereignty and hosting. we should verify that we hosting infrastructure meets the required standards and certifications to mitigate any potential risks." ;
