    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client seeks an approach that optimizes cost while ensuring the expected level of service." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's financials, active project budgets, daily rates, overhead, cash position, tender eligibility thresholds, and cost sensitivity parameters as of 2024, what is our company's projected margin on The project, and are there cost-optimization strategies our company's can propose? our company's, has an annual revenue of €6,200,000 with a near break-even result, indicating a slight positive EBITDA. our company's have a comfortable cash runway thanks to our company's Series A funding of €12,000,000 raised in 2024. our company's financial capacity is above the typical thresholds for a €900,000 / 5-year public contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The project budget and duration, our company's can estimate the average annual operating cost to be around €180,000." ;
