    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's standard daily rates for various roles and our company's target gross margin range of 25% to 35%, our company's can aim to optimize costs while meeting the client's expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To propose a cost-optimization strategy, our company's could consider the following: 1. **Tier and model selection**: our company's cost structure note mentions that hosting and inference vary materially with the hosting tier and model option selected." ;
