    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Choosing a more cost-efficient tier and model combination could help reduce recurring costs. 2. **Resource allocation**: our company's can optimize resource allocation by assigning tasks to team members with appropriate daily rates, ensuring that The project is staffed efficiently without compromising on quality. 3. **Change management and training**: By including change management support and staff training in our company's proposal, our company's can help the client minimize additional costs associated with implementing the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming our company's can maintain our company's target gross margin range, our company's projected margin on The project could be between 25% to 35% of the total contract value." ;
