        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components can we design to meet these requirements, and what innovation strategy can we propose?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements, our company Faber IA can leverage our company Faber IA existing capabilities in AI and innovation. we can design an AI-powered solution that incorporates retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) to provide drafting assistance for clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries, medical reports, and patient letters. we solution can include a hybrid retrieval approach, combining lexical and semantic search to facilitate access to relevant information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts. include will enable staff to quickly access reliable and up-to-date information, supporting staff daily activities and decision-making processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To support medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A), we can integrate structured extraction capabilities into Our solution, allowing for efficient and accurate coding of medical data. integrate will help reduce processing times and improve the overall quality of care." ;
