    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, how can our company's ensure the CSR and sustainability posture of our company's tender response?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR and Sustainability officer for our company's, I can ensure that our tender response aligns with The client requirements by highlighting our company's existing commitments and capabilities.  our company's have already published our company's CSR statement, which demonstrates our company's dedication to corporate social responsibility. our company's EcoVadis rating is Silver, indicating a strong commitment to sustainability. our company's have also conducted a bilan carbone, which shows our company's awareness of our company's carbon footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of reducing energy consumption, our company's can leverage our company's green hosting partners, such as OuraneCloud, who use renewable energy and have a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's practice digital sobriety through model right-sizing, caching, and batching, which helps minimize our company's environmental impact. our company's is also committed to social responsibilities, including being a signatory to the responsible tech charter, having gender balance and inclusion objectives, and participating in an apprenticeship and work-study program." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must take the dossier context into account where available." ;
