    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding AI ethics, our company's have published an ethics charter that outlines our company's principles, including human oversight, transparency, bias monitoring, data minimization, and documented data-use policy. an ethics charter that outlines our principles, including human oversight, transparency, bias monitoring, data minimization, and documented data-use policy is reviewed by compliance, ensuring our company's adhere to regulatory requirements such as the EU AI Act." ;
