    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) has 1200 beds and a staff size of 4500, and requires an AI assistance solution that improves staff efficiency and quality and safety of care delivered to patients. an AI assistance solution that improves staff efficiency and quality and safety of care delivered to patients integrates with the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), providing drafting assistance for clinical and administrative content, such as discharge summaries, medical reports, and patient letters. an AI assistance solution that improves staff efficiency and quality and safety of care delivered to patients also supports medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A) and handles dossiers by surfacing relevant information and recalling applicable rules." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our team, comprising a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, security compliance lead, and other experts, will work together to deliver an AI assistance solution that improves staff efficiency and quality and safety of care delivered to patients using a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure. an AI assistance solution that improves staff efficiency and quality and safety of care delivered to patients will be hosted on SecNumCloud qualified infrastructure, ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements such as GDPR and French HDS certification. the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) project will have a budget of 900,000 over 5 years, with an annual operating cost that must remain controlled and compatible with the authority's budgetary capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

